#: src-en/data/events_special_defeat.xml.append:29
msgid ""
"data/events_special_defeat.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_SMUGGLER\"]/text[1]"
msgstr "当走私船解体时，你突然想到，联邦过去曾雇佣过走私者为其服务。你希望刚刚那个被你击毁的倒霉鬼不是联邦的供应商。"

#: src-en/data/events_special_defeat.xml.append:30
msgid ""
"data/events_special_defeat.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_SMUGGLER\"]/text[2]"
msgstr "那艘走私船已被打成废铁，他们的货物也在烈火中焚毁。"

